      "scenarios": [
        {
          "answer": 0,
          "choices": [
            "Pivot table \u2014 drag-and-drop grouping/summarizing for exploration; formulas (SUMIFS/COUNTIFS) for fixed, auditable calculations",
            "Formulas for everything \u2014 pivots aren't reproducible",
            "Pivot tables can't handle large data",
