          "title": "The feature fallacy",
          "why": "Correlation: X-users retain more. Causation would need: X causes retention. The confounder: power users both adopt features and retain \u2014 X is a marker of engagement, not its cause. Before acting on correlation: name plausible confounders, segment (does X help within engagement bands?), and run an experiment. Observational wins are hypotheses, not conclusions."
        },
