          "situation": "A readout lists 15 findings. Stakeholders remember none and ask 'so what do we do?'",
          "title": "The 15 findings",
          "why": "Narrative arc: context (what's happening), complication (the tension/change), resolution (what we should do). Fifteen findings with no arc = fifteen forgettable facts. Group findings into 2-3 insights that build to one recommendation. Stories are memory structures \u2014 the same data, shaped as tension\u2192resolution, gets remembered and acted on."
        },
        {
