          "situation": "A finding ('the flagship feature hurts retention') blindsides its owner in a big review. The meeting derails into methodology debate.",
          "title": "The ambush",
          "why": "Pre-wire controversial findings: walk key stakeholders through the analysis 1:1 before the forum \u2014 hear objections, stress-test the logic, adjust where they're right. The big meeting then decides rather than discovers. An ambush triggers defensiveness; a pre-wired finding gets a fair hearing. It's not politics \u2014 it's giving the analysis its best chance to be judged on merit."
