      "title": "Storytelling \u2014 Core concepts",
      "concepts": [
        "Pyramid principle: answer first ('We should do X'), then the 2-3 supporting reasons, then details as backup.",
        "Message titles: action titles state the insight ('Enterprise churn doubled after onboarding changes'), not the content ('Churn by segment').",
        "Communicating uncertainty: honest uncertainty: ranges instead of point estimates, key assumptions stated, sensitivity to drivers ('\u00b13 points if renewal rate moves 5%'), and pre-mortem ('what would change this conclusion').",
        "Narrative arc: context (what's happening), complication (the tension/change), resolution (what we should do)."
